{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55897","headline":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 五十四 · 居遁","name":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 五十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"未了及（《祖堂集》卷八作「之」）时亲遍礼，不须（《祖堂集》作「应」）端坐守清贫。\n直似罗睺罗（《祖堂集》作「行」）密行，争（《祖堂集》作「岂」）如迦叶不闻闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"居遁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55897.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55897","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}